      "height": 430,
      "id": "c01a47291ab625b5",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-squared\n---\n\n> [!cc-header] Customer\n\n+Id: int\n+Name: string\n+Address: string \n+PhoneNo: int\n+AcctNo: int\n\n> [!cc-footer] <span></span>\n+Generalinquiry()\n+DepositMoney()\n+WithdrawMoney()\n+OpenAccount()\n+CloseAccount()\n+ApplyForLoan()\n+RequestCard()",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 220,
      "x": -500,
      "y": -10
    },
    {
      "height": 200,
      "id": "6b9bc8186996bdeb",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-squared\n---\n\n> [!cc-header] Bank\n\n+BankId: int\n+Name: string\n+Location: string`\n\n> [!cc-footer] <span></span>",
